      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "商业银行接受其他单位委托开展代理业务收费时，应当将委托方名称、服务项目、收费金额、咨询（投诉）的联系方式等信息告知客户，并在提供给客户的确认单据中明确标注上述信息。",
      "quoteHash": "b090124de9503e1e95824803a54d5a656d4bfcb8e75f2d2c8142e2a487c3c58c",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "300f1d6d68b475c37042e6782d7f882b8105dfca0121a4150879e19b9787d24b",
      "sourceId": "REG-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-XFAM-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGXFAM001-20260922-300f1d6d",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGXFAM001-07da9e97",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGXFAM001-0025",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十五条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "商业银行应当严格执行服务价格信息披露的有关规定，在为客户提供服务之前，应当告知相关服务项目、服务价格、优惠措施（含生效和终止日期），客户确认接受该服务价格后，方可提供相关服务；客户在使用服务前明确表示不接受相关服务价格的，不得强制或变相强制客户接受服务。",
      "quoteHash": "07da9e9753e7afda4eb755c09ace8b799b01026864390b1e904f9ad2fc2887a4",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "300f1d6d68b475c37042e6782d7f882b8105dfca0121a4150879e19b9787d24b",
      "sourceId": "REG-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-XFAM-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGXFAM001-20260922-300f1d6d",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGXFAM001-08d9f68a",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGXFAM001-0026",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十六条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "对于需要签署服务章程、协议等合同文件的银行服务项目，商业银行应当在相应的合同文件中以通俗易懂、清晰醒目的方式明示服务项目或服务内容、服务价格、优惠措施及其生效和终止日期、与价格相关的例外条款和限制性条款、咨询（投诉）的联系方式等信息。",
      "quoteHash": "08d9f68a03ffe09551b1f9b8842b0dc8777550766ac65e21f8072a72ca843cce",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "300f1d6d68b475c37042e6782d7f882b8105dfca0121a4150879e19b9787d24b",
      "sourceId": "REG-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-XFAM-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGXFAM001-20260922-300f1d6d",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGXFAM001-13ae86c2",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGXFAM001-0027",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十七条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "商业银行应当按照审慎经营原则，建立健全服务价格管理制度和内部控制机制，建立清晰的服务价格制定、调整和信息披露流程，严格执行内部授权管理。",
      "quoteHash": "13ae86c292d6975d00353b917ed55f832c845d61d76ca50497ad2703850294ed",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "300f1d6d68b475c37042e6782d7f882b8105dfca0121a4150879e19b9787d24b",
      "sourceId": "REG-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-XFAM-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGXFAM001-20260922-300f1d6d",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGXFAM001-985d65af",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGXFAM001-0028",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "商业银行服务价格管理制度应当严格遵守国家法律法规，明确价格行为违规的问责机制和内部处罚措施。",
      "quoteHash": "985d65af62c9b7ed06ccc006c8a4292ad33671ab4264e973a3eda1cad2d2bdc5",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "300f1d6d68b475c37042e6782d7f882b8105dfca0121a4150879e19b9787d24b",
      "sourceId": "REG-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-XFAM-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGXFAM001-20260922-300f1d6d",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGXFAM001-90975e23",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGXFAM001-0029",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十九条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "商业银行应当指定一个部门牵头负责服务价格管理工作，建立服务价格内部审批制度，适时对服务价格管理进行评估和检查，及时纠正相关问题，并组织开展服务价格相关宣传、解释、投诉处理等工作。",
      "quoteHash": "90975e23a1c2b26b5f0b52d58981c788b7530d1c1131772048b9e05ad74352ca",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "300f1d6d68b475c37042e6782d7f882b8105dfca0121a4150879e19b9787d24b",
      "sourceId": "REG-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-XFAM-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGXFAM001-20260922-300f1d6d",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGXFAM001-2bd78f4f",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGXFAM001-0030",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "商业银行应当建立服务价格投诉管理制度，明确客户投诉登记、调查、处理、报告等事项的管理流程、负责部门和处理期限，确保对客户投诉及时进行调查处理。",
      "quoteHash": "2bd78f4f3aaa4833692c34d9c5389e030d82366268cdb9068dd0513a15764833",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "300f1d6d68b475c37042e6782d7f882b8105dfca0121a4150879e19b9787d24b",
      "sourceId": "REG-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-XFAM-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGXFAM001-20260922-300f1d6d",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGXFAM001-d57e7327",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGXFAM001-0031",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "商业银行应当设立统一的投诉电话、书面投诉联系方式等渠道，并在营业场所和网站醒目位置进行公示，以便及时受理客户对服务价格的相关投诉。",
      "quoteHash": "d57e732729734995b90ab79d5e3ab6cc5fc484d1ecb8642457a1ad343796bed9",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "300f1d6d68b475c37042e6782d7f882b8105dfca0121a4150879e19b9787d24b",
      "sourceId": "REG-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-XFAM-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGXFAM001-20260922-300f1d6d",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGXFAM001-fd8cf7ce",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGXFAM001-0033",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "除国家法律、法规、委托代理合同有相关规定和要求的情况以外，商业银行应当拒绝任何单位和个人利用银行渠道直接向客户收取任何费用。",
      "quoteHash": "fd8cf7ce9d80b79dcc348ae9daa37a16608ec1a87bdb58c13c01b88eb4f640b5",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "300f1d6d68b475c37042e6782d7f882b8105dfca0121a4150879e19b9787d24b",
      "sourceId": "REG-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-XFAM-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGXFAM001-20260922-300f1d6d",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGXFAM001-30137370",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGXFAM001-0034",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "商业银行违反本办法规定，有下列行为之一的，由中国银行业监督管理委员会、国务院价格主管部门按照各自法定职责，依据《中华人民共和国银行业监督管理法》、《中华人民共和国价格法》、《价格违法行为行政处罚规定》等法律法规处理：",
      "quoteHash": "30137370b09567b0c8666490bdb783b9c126024107c1674622a220c42bdaa661",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "300f1d6d68b475c37042e6782d7f882b8105dfca0121a4150879e19b9787d24b",
      "sourceId": "REG-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-XFAM-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGXFAM001-20260922-300f1d6d",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGXFAM001-1c085d53",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGXFAM001-0035",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十五条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "鼓励有关单位和个人对商业银行服务价格违法行为进行监督。",
      "quoteHash": "1c085d5301cdc4c5249dd81042270b482cab13deb024cc8258488b2a772997c5",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "300f1d6d68b475c37042e6782d7f882b8105dfca0121a4150879e19b9787d24b",
      "sourceId": "REG-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-XFAM-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGXFAM001-20260922-300f1d6d",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGXFAM001-469ff9f8",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGXFAM001-0036",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十六条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "行业协会等自律组织应当在规范商业银行服务价格行为方面充分发挥自律协调作用。",
      "quoteHash": "469ff9f8bd4d9681389d05ccc9f257a0629eae826bfab4748fba2df17e7c616a",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "300f1d6d68b475c37042e6782d7f882b8105dfca0121a4150879e19b9787d24b",
      "sourceId": "REG-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-XFAM-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGXFAM001-20260922-300f1d6d",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGXFAM001-da87a418",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGXFAM001-0037",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十七条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本办法自2014年8月1日起施行。《商业银行服务价格管理暂行办法》（中国银行业监督管理委员会　国家发展和改革委员会令2003年第3号）同时废止。",
      "quoteHash": "da87a4185918cef0b6b738cfd782916bff313297730d993e4a208aff49f8f57e",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "300f1d6d68b475c37042e6782d7f882b8105dfca0121a4150879e19b9787d24b",
      "sourceId": "REG-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-XFAM-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGXFAM001-20260922-300f1d6d",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGXFAM001-1a9a3e10",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGXFAM001-0038",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本办法生效后，此前有关商业银行服务价格或收费的规定与本办法规定不一致的，按照本办法执行。",
      "quoteHash": "1a9a3e1002afbb043c7a5cc4d59b3ec88aacd957deb6755c3f55b4243ebadd2c",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "300f1d6d68b475c37042e6782d7f882b8105dfca0121a4150879e19b9787d24b",
      "sourceId": "REG-XFAM-001",
